{
"Items.BalletDress.Desc": "A replica of a dress worn by a female follower of a forgotten deity, resembling a ballet dress. Ornamented with plenty of bows and ruffles, it is sure to stand out in a crowd. It provides no physical protection, but is quite easy to move in, and despite a lack of enchantments, there is something mystical about it."
"Items.BalletDress.Long": "a frilly ballet dress"
"Items.BalletDress.Short": "Ballet Dress"
}
